[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0010","text":"好厉害……！\n好漂亮的，服装……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0020","text":"啊，是啊\n而且也很适合甜花哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0030","text":"嘿嘿……\n谢谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0040","text":"──制作人……\n甜花呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0050","text":"拿到ALSTROEMERIA的……\n新服装的时候……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0060","text":"和小奈、千雪小姐\n同款的东西变多了……好开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0070","text":"哈哈，是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0080","text":"甜花是这样一件一件地珍惜着每套服装的啊。真让人高兴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0090","text":"昵嘿嘿……\n嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500200_02_0100","text":"──所以……这套同款也要……\n好好珍惜……！"}]
